Description: native, offline-first email client
 Yours is a native Rust and Slint desktop mail client with offline-first
 storage, Gmail and Microsoft account support, contacts, and calendars.
 .
 Mail sync, OAuth and the optional local Reacher address check use the
 network. Passwords, OAuth tokens and API keys are stored in the freedesktop
 Secret Service (GNOME Keyring, KWallet or KeePassXC), never in the message
 database. PDF preview needs a separately packaged libpdfium; without it PDF
 attachments open in the external viewer.
